# RestA UI registry

| Need | Path |
| --- | --- |
| Brand contract | `brand/DESIGN.md` |
| Live tweaks | `public/brand/tweaks` |
| Token bridge | `src/app.css` |
| Primitives / atoms | `src/kit` |
| Document / stage | `index.html`, `src/App.svelte` |
| Page sections | `src/blocks` |
| Demo copy / fixtures | `src/lib/content.ts` |

Do not hand-grow a second primitive tree. New atoms → kit (ui8kit codegen).
Re-emit brand from BrandOSS `.project/resta-brand/` — do not invent a parallel palette.
